WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 0.2 · Start Here: Your Organisation Journey
Your organisation profile

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
One page of plain facts that people read first and you reuse everywhere.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Use plain words: what you do, for whom, where.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. State your legal form, stage and size honestly.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Write open decisions as questions, not guesses.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara Girls in Science: weekly after-school science clubs for girls aged 10–14 in 14 Kisumu public schools. Registered nonprofit, six staff, 25 volunteer mentors.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your one-page organisation profile in six parts.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
